        {
            "block_label": "vision_footnote",
            "block_content": "The byte order of all input data elements for AES-GCM-256 encryption, as specified by [V2G20-2497], shall be big-endian. This includes leading zeros needed in any data element to reach the length as prescribed by [V2G20-2497] or NIST Special Publication 800-38D.",
