        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2499]\nThe IV (as defined by [V2G20-2497]) shall be transmitted in the 12 most significant bytes of the SECP521_EncryptedPrivateKey field. The ciphertext (encrypted private key) of 66 bytes shall be written after the IV in the SECP521_EncryptedPrivateKey field. The tag (as defined by [V2G20-2494]) shall make up the 16 least significant bytes of the SECP521_EncryptedPrivateKey field.",
            "block_bbox": [
